  "details": "Works fine on Unity, but FX layer is stuck in VRC only when running in VR mode\n\nUploading again with the latest SDK and Unity does not fix the problem.\n\nNo matter if WrightDefault is on or off.\n\nIt freezes more frequently when WrightDefault is on.\n\nIt doesn't freeze on desktop.\n\nWhen I check in the debug window, Animation transition is working.\n\nFX layer weight is also normal\n\nMask is off.\n\nThere is no empty State with no Animation set.\n\nWhen I ask other people, the timing of stuck is different depending on the person due to synchronization error (e.g. default expression from my point of view, but stuck in smiling state from other people's point of view, etc.)\n\nHand signs (Gesture layer) work fine.\n\nAlso, this bug has occurred since the update when Japanese and other localizations were added to VRChat.\n\nBefore that, it was working fine.",
